<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR RATES MIXED AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR RATES MIXED AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>mixed the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Thursday. The</p>
<p>three-mth rate inched one bps higher to 3.10 pct.</p>
<p>				    July 31 fix	   July 30 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.00 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.05 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.10 pct		3.09 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.23 pct		3.23 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.39 pct		3.38 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.54 pct		3.54 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 292, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
